-oo","agent_clan_generation":"20260817120236","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-oo.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-oo[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Fix the second round of inaccurate Statistics tab data[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every number, label, and metric definition rendered by the Admin [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Center Statistics tab matches what its producer actually computes, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]including the All time range, the Perf subsystem latency counts, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the Overview commits tile, and the silently truncated XPrompts [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]breakdowns.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]statistics_tab_accuracy_round_two.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/statistics_tab_accuracy_round_two.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-oo[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-oo/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Correct the Rust statistics counters and expose breakdown [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]truncation[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]core-counters[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-counters: in ../sase-core, make `committing_agents` count distinct [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]agent names and add `committing_runs`, stop counting a missing archive [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project spec as malformed, scope `user_hidden_skipped` to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]runner-eligible rows, add per-row xprompt breakdown truncation counts, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bump the wire schema, and update the pinned version in this repo's core [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validator.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop asserting zero samples and meaningless shares in Perf [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]latency rows[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]perf-latency[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]perf-latency: make the By Subsystem Count column render an unknown count[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]as an em dash instead of 0, remove the incommensurable Share denominator[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for that grouping, and define the Launch hero tile's statistic in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Perf legend.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make the All time window and empty-window states honest[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]range-window[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]range-window: replace the epoch-derived All time absolute label, clamp [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the Overview runs-over-time buckets to the observed data instead of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]emitting one row per day since 1970, and stop the run-count empty state [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from hiding log-backed Activity and Plans & Questions data.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render the corrected core counters and disclose XPrompt [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]truncation[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]consume-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-counters[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]consume-core: read the new wire fields so the Overview commits tile [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stops labelling runs as agents, correct the Projects malformed-file [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]footnote and the stale Specs column, disclose the XPrompts breakdown [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]truncation, split the XPrompts Share legend by denominator, and refresh [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the affected PNG goldens.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-oo","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-oo.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-942edaa02ee82c471ec52568c138a45f","started_at":"2026-08-17T16:02:55.197409+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1786984272,"sha":"56dbeb2f6d9715dc6710eb4ba0e78c9dc408fd0b","subject":"fix(stats): make All time window and empty-window states honest"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"15cdccc225f130aa3e4b7d1fd3029376f14022f7d4408093cd8cbd74b5381598","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-oo.3/chat.md","size_bytes":9827},"commits":{"digest":"324a1c10cde86f44c9c702f14464d0e2e1f21eea1fee97146d2dbec2c644797f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-oo.3/commits.json","size_bytes":241},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-oo.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"028c3ef01795929f799ad8634bea594b494d3b0dc9d477e4e6337b405cd38aa2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-oo.3/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"dd24d35fa1599d2dffec43a3ea3b0f7e1eef80fc5e93fcded0790d0ac470e606","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-oo.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":109},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"b13cac4a05125082d79c81c2ec2021d65526080ff93f6a21dbabb114c7814d1a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-oo.3/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":14099},"state":{"digest":"8011b43a46fad9b62af8b0050e08480985b95ab0ec365d447814d099cf7bebd5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-oo.3/state.json","size_bytes":183}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-oo.3","local_name":"sase-oo